ano lo hizo a escala nacional: subestimó a veinte mil emús y gastó diez balas por cada pájaro.","coach_ejemplo":"\"I bit off more than I could chew when I signed up for three courses at once.\" — Mordí más de lo que podía masticar cuando me inscribí en tres cursos a la vez.","coach_cierre":"¿En qué proyecto asumiste más de lo que realmente podías manejar?"},{"expresion":"to wave the white flag","linea_aprox":32,"coach_intro":"\"To wave the white flag\" viene del campo de batalla: la bandera blanca señala rendición. Hoy se usa para admitir derrota en cualquier contexto, desde una discusión hasta un mueble imposible de armar. En el episodio, el ejército la agitó... ante unos pájaros.","coach_ejemplo":"\"After the third failed attempt, I waved the white flag and asked for help.\" — Después del tercer intento fallido, agité la bandera blanca y pedí ayuda.","coach_cierre":"¿Cuándo fue la última vez que te rendiste y pediste ayuda?"}],"onda":[1,0.899,1,0.989,0.89,0.831,0.885,1,0.902,1,0.838,0.844,0.703,0.984,0.766,0.975,0.861,0.891,0.748,0.847,0.737,0.802,0.99,0.917,0.864,0.714,0.897,0.794,0.88,0.929,0.785,0.742,0.919,0.841,0.914,0.568,1,1,0.867,0.993,0.866,0.786,0.624,0.81,0.822,0.816,0.794,0.797,0.774,0.852,1,0.874,0.849,0.922,0.898,0.74,0.956,0.9,0.945,0.767,0.762,0.805,0.861,0.841,0.776,0.781,0.799,0.78,0.804,0.959,0.902,0.753,0.927,0.91,0.821,0.751,1,0.916,0.844,0.909,0.854,0.718,0.784,0.829,0.95,0.888,0.835,0.849,0.881,0.868,0.855,0.979,0.874,0.939,0.859,0.8,0.945,0.783,0.873,0.896,0.86,0.776,0.96,0.81,0.928,0.81,0.794,0.801,0.839,0.782,0.67,0.701,0.849,0.889,0.864,0.774,0.722,0.798,0.806,0.663,1,0.878,0.849,0.849,0.765,0.784,0.672,0.796,0.762,0.925,0.74,0.888,0.789,0.772,0.688,0.939,0.718,0.841,0.862,0.828,0.87,1,0.864,0.856,0.738,0.865,0.794,1,0.85,0.809,0.617,0.867,0.723,0.673,0.604,0.856,0.873,0.879,0.788,0.852,0.82,0.989,0.732,0.792,0.762,0.927,0.759,0.789,0.707,0.801,0.79,0.76,0.739,0.725,0.914,0.841,1,0.902,0.783,0.811,0.687,0.909,0.806,0.881,0.785,0.707,0.83